# Interceptor Mechan {2}{B}{R} 2/2 flying: "When this creature enters, return target artifact or creature card from your graveyard to your hand." and "Void - At the beginning of your end
# step, if a nonland permanent left the battlefield this turn or a spell was warped this turn, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." Turn 1: Bot1's Bolt kills its own Ornithopter (an
# artifact creature card in its graveyard, beside the Bolt - an instant, no target - and on turn 2 Bot2 casts a Memnite). Turn 3: a second Bolt kills Bot2's Memnite (the opponent's graveyard
# card is no target of Bot1's, and stays there) and the Mechan, cast after it, returns the Ornithopter. The Memnite left the battlefield this turn: at the end step the Mechan gets
# a counter, a 3/3 (CR 603.4).

